      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "Cochrane Reviews of interventions that applied NMA were included. We excluded protocols, withdrawn reviews, overview of reviews, and diagnostic test accuracy reviews.",
      "reason": "The eligibility criteria for included study/review characteristics (e.g., intervention reviews using NMA; exclusions such as protocols/withdrawn/overview/diagnostic test accuracy) are specified, but there is no explicit specification of all study characteristics needed for eligibility (e.g., follow-up requirements, full question-framework components, and other required study-design/setting details)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "The CDSR was searched for NMAs to 15 th January 2024 (see S1 File for search strategy). The publication of each review was obtained.",
      "reason": "The evidence provides a dissemination/search time limit and indicates publication information was obtained, but it does not specify report characteristics such as language restrictions or publication/report status (e.g., unpublished reports)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence is provided that the review distinguishes exclusion because outcomes were not measured versus exclusion because outcome results were not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_20",
      "quote": "Matching NMA and PW-MA reviews. Thirty-eight of the 60 NMA reviews were matched to PW-MA reviews.",
      "reason": "The evidence describes grouping/matching of Network Meta-Analysis (NMA) reviews and pair-wise meta-analysis (PW-MA) reviews, but it does not clearly specify the groups used in each synthesis and explicitly link them to the comparisons defined in the review objectives (objectives not shown in the retrieved evidence)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "We excluded reviews that applied indirect comparison methods (e.g. calculating the difference between results obtained from pairwise meta-analyses) rather than NMA models because indirect comparisons are made in reviews without using searchable terminology.",
      "reason": "A rationale is explicitly provided for excluding certain review types (indirect comparison methods rather than NMA models)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 72
